  "instance_name": "racial_stereotype_tanning_as_proxy_for_race",
  "label": "Racial Stereotype: Tanning as Proxy for Race",
  "description": "The meme relies on the stereotype that a tan skin tone can be mistaken for a racial identity (e.g., Black or Brown), implying that tanning is a superficial characteristic that can explain skin color rather than acknowledging deeper racial identity. This stereotype reduces complex social issues to physical appearance and can be seen as a form of microaggression or racial humor that may be offensive to some.",
